      "pos": "RIGHT:FADEIN",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Hart appeared in front of Yuma in the middle of a busy street."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "harttenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "I know that kid. It's Kite's little brother."
    },
    {
      "char": "harttenjo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "torimeadows",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Where do you think he was heading?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I have no idea. We should get him back to Kite, so we'll have to track him down somehow."
    },
    {
      "char": "torimeadows",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "Yeah, but... You know what's gonna happen if you see Kite."
    },
    {
      "char": "torimeadows",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "There's gonna be trash talk and then a duel and... and if you lose, then..."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "How about we worry about that part when we get to it."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "torimeadows",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Yuma tracked Hart down and followed him to the top of a mysterious tower."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "While at the top of the tower, Yuma and Hart were confronted by Quinton."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "I'm Hart's friend."
    },
    {
      "char": "harttenjo",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I'm here to help. Isn't that right, Hart?"
    },
    {
      "char": "harttenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Hart will be perfectly safe with me, I assure you. Let's go."
    },
    {
      "char": "harttenjo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "quinton",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "After Hart was taken by Quinton, Yuma had to team up with Kite in order to find him."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Tell me where Hart is!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "The guy you sent came in a chopper to pick up your brother."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I didn't send anyone to pick him up."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Then he wasn't your friend?"
    },
    {
      "char": "orbital7",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Stop trying to fool us!"
    },
    {
      "char": "orbital7",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "We weren't manufactured yesterday, you know."
    },
    {
      "char": "orbital7",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "It's my fault. I shouldn't have let Hart go."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Hart isn't well. I hope I find him soon."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "I’ll help you find him!"
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "This is my problem, not yours."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I made a promise to Hart that I'd bring you both back together."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "discouragement",
      "text": "...Fine."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Yuma and Kite eventually tracked Quinton and Hart down. Quinton was with his two brothers, Quattro and Trey."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "quattro",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "If it isn't the infamous Kite. What an honor."
    },
    {
      "char": "yumatsukumo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Hey, it's Quattro!"
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Are you the ones who took my brother?"
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Where is he?"
    },
    {
      "char": "quattro",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Relax. No harm has come to him."
    },
    {
      "char": "quattro",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile2",
      "text": "At least... not yet. Heh."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "What's that supposed to mean?"
    },
    {
      "char": "quattro",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "When we're finished, we'll turn Hart back over to you... or whatever's left of him."
    },
    {
      "char": "kitetenjo",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "I'll crush you creeps and get my brother out of here!"
    },
    {
      "char": "quattro",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "I'd like to see you try. Trey, take out this twerp for me."
    },
    {
      "char": "quattro",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "trey",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "With pleasure! Let's duel!"
    }
  ]
